# Allow the page to READ its own audio, not just play it.
#
# The Listening Room is served from two addresses: this site's own
# noblemusic.netlify.app, and noblefathercreations.com/music via the hub's proxy
# rewrite. From the hub address the audio files are cross-origin, and a
# cross-origin media element silently taints the Web Audio graph -- the
# AnalyserNode then returns nothing but zeros, so the frequency display would be
# dead. This header is what lets the page opt in to a real spectrum.
#
# The page never assumes this header is present: it probes for CORS first and only
# sets crossorigin="anonymous" if the probe succeeds, and it drops crossorigin
# again on any media error. If this file goes missing, the visualisation falls
# back to its CSS bars and PLAYBACK IS UNAFFECTED.

/audio/*
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
